# Cursor AI Rules
# Single source of truth: AGENTS.md

Always refer to and strictly follow [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for:
- System Architecture (Vertical Slice / Modular Monolith in `services/api/app/modules/`)
- Unit of work and transaction rules (no `commit()` in services)
- Git & Atomic Commits Protocol (commit after each milestone: Schema -> Service -> Router -> Tasks)
- Verification Quality Gate (`make format && make check` before every commit)
- Conventional Commits (`feat(scope): ...`, `fix(scope): ...`)
